<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Self-Improving VLA Policies: Selected Diffusion Noise for Spurious-Robust Action Smoothing</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">
<span id="id1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:345.0pt;">
